{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Hello tinkerbot!\" Web says. \"Know much about mason history?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:14:18.181000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743004420412932106","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"IIIII am EEEquiped with much of the records of the Masons. How may I be of assistance?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:14:50.897000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743004557633650729","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"What can you tell about old fight with hunger? One where tinkers lost tongues.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:15:37.184000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743004751775531028","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Thhe Heroes of the Last Croatoan Cycle wwwere before that Designation was assumed by Croatoan. Master Dregen was the leader of the Masons.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:16:50.116000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743005057674641418","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Web nods. \"Why didn't tinkers kill hunger? Could they?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:17:26.088000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743005208552013854","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The Masons did Slay Croatoan. Bbbbut his form can not be permanently killed on this plane of existence. Entering the Abyss is likely to kill anyone who tries. Records show that the last group of 5 to attempt it fought valiantly but were slain. I believe this happened on your last voyage.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:19:18.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743005679270363147","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Web nods. \"How could kill him in abyss?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:20:22.836000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743005949886988328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Other attempts have been made. But with out the proper tools it cannot be bound to this plane.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:20:28.788000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743005974851223574","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Or bind to plane?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:20:47.335000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743006052643110943","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"If Croatoan is prevented from returning to the Abyss, it is theoretically possible to permanently kill it. Powerful tools would be required.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:21:53.206000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743006328926240768","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The abyssal plane is infinitely deep, but at some point it is said that there is nothing but more Sibriex. It is not one of a kind. It is simply the most determined.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:22:44.573000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743006544374792222","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"They are the Elders of the Abyss to whom the rulers go to to seek wisdom and power.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:23:14.454000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743006669704790116","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"They are akin to shaman of the Abyss.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:23:25.507000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743006716064432218","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Web thinks for a moment. \"What are these tools? Do the knights have some?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:23:32.859000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743006746900955136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Also, what can tinkerbot tell about first knight? Web hear used to be mason.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:26:17.824000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743007438814445638","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The tools the Knights wield are one possible solution, it is true. BBBBBut our relationship with the Wardens is symbiotic. The Knights may have ulterior purposes. To claim a foot hold in the New world for the Gods of the Old world. While it is advantageous to align with those who fight for the Gods who are aligned to the good. We fear that it may also become a foot hold for evil.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:26:21.438000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743007453972791396","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Wardens? Like Lolth?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:27:20.146000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743007700211728395","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Venrir was a great warrior. And an avatar of justice. But his valor required tempering. Hiram promoted Master Dregen to ensure that his lawfulness would be held with checks and balances as is needed when governing. Daysong's approach was quite different, leaning on the lessons of Master Dregen and Hiram.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:29:18.344000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743008195970072626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Lolth is not a warden. Lolth is an Old world God.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:29:59.035000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743008366640758784","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"What are wardens then?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:30:14.923000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743008433279860746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Daysong was contemporary of Venrir?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:30:27.785000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743008487226998875","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Who was Dregen?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:30:32.342000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743008506340442165","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The Wardens are the Governors of Arcania. In the absence of Gods, the spell weave coalesced upon the four mortals who were appointed.  They both are and are not people. The forces of creation bend before them but unlike the old gods they are not divided by portfolios.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:32:28.311000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743008992749682769","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Daysong was the Master Mason of Shangri La. He was in contact through magical means with many other masons.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:33:27.728000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743009241962512454","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Dregen is a dwarf. The keeper of the Ossuary.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:33:59.116000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743009373613457428","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Spellweave: the way through which raw magic is accessed.","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:37:04.663000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-12T07:37:15.773000Z","id":"743010151853981736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"How old was Daysong?\"\n\"What do wardens do? How Lolth contact Web if gods not have foothold?\"\n\"Would other contact Web for Lolth in steed?\"\n\"If both good and evil gods came to new world, what happen?\"\n\"How symbiotic?\"\n\"What the ossuary?\" \n\"Who are four wardens?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:37:44.250000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743010317893632003","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Web looks to the statues. \"Those the wardens?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:37:59.318000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743010381093404743","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The Age of Both the Sasquatch Bigfoot and the Yeti Daysong is estimated 1988 years. The are conflicting accounts. But that is the generally accepted number.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:39:08.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743010670894645358","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The wardens guard the New World and extend it's timeline greatly in comparison to the Old world, stretching out the Croataon Cycle over hundreds of years while in relative time in the Old world it is always exactly 50 years between cycles.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:40:28.201000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743011005553967136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Messages can still pass between The Wardens and the Old World Gods. They do have reasons from time to time to communicate.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:41:21.030000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743011227135115324","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Prayers to Old World Gods are an example of messages that the Wardens often send. however they are within their rights not to.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:42:25.590000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743011497919250534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"If both the Good and Evil Gods of the Old world came to Roanoke, it is likely that their power struggles and wars would be enacted here, just as they are there.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:43:18.988000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743011721886826626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"It is symbiotic in that they are the patrons of the Tinkers. An organization of the new world responisble for repairing the crack in the World's Cornerstone.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:44:10.750000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743011938992259182","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The Ossuary is a sacred place hidden from Croatoan. It holds the bones of every tinker. It holds their most sacred treasures and secrets, and is rarely accessible.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:45:43.951000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743012329905586276","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The four wardens are Oro, the white Lion. His Capitol city is the River of Angels and is responsible for the south west. He champions the rights of every creature to choose it's own path. Fontaine is the warden of life. Set in the Jungles of Florida, she guards the Fountin of life. Cascadia is the Warden of the North West. For her, the pursuit of happiness is the prime virtue. Columbia is our nearest warden. The seven isles of liberty are her home in the north east. Her virtue is Liberty.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:49:03.369000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743013166325432351","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Yes.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:49:13.052000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-12T07:49:18.745000Z","id":"743013206938746900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Web nods in thanks and continues.\n\"Daysong was there when fight hunger? Or communciate with fighters like tinkerbot say?\"\n\"Cycle? Could cycle be stopped if hunger bound and killed?\"\n\"Is cycle happening soon? Already started?\"\n\"Where world's cornerstone?\"\n\"Could contact Dregen? Get help with cycle breaking?\"\n\"Tinkerbot know what Lolth want? Would wardens? If wardens do know, how Web ask?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:50:07.739000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743013436312780844","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Daysong and Hiram are leaders of the Old World Masons and New World Masons respectively.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:51:03.447000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743013669968937052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Theoretically, yes.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:51:20.331000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743013740785434626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The Cycle is nearing it's end. Relative time is hard to track, but old world time it is only hours away.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:51:48.931000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-12T07:54:38.065000Z","id":"743013860742791278","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The World's Cornerstone is a Tesseract that is both at the center of the worlds and it's edges. The Rose line is an example of one of the edges.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:52:33.229000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743014046541807646","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Contacting Dregen would be extremely beneficial.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:53:06.909000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743014187806228500","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Tinkerbot does not deign to know the whims of Old World Evil Gods. It may be possible to contact a warden, but more often, they contact you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:53:52.689000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-12T07:53:59.723000Z","id":"743014379821465620","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
