{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"A tesseract is a fourth dimensional cube.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:55:11.929000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743014712178114560","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The Masons do not have a record of the Tinker's methods of repair. Or, It was not added to my repository of knowledge.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:56:02.533000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743014924426674239","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"It is said that a key is required to open the Ossuary.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:56:18.351000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743014990772043786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Web brightens at this. \n\"Kiln find key! Use at forge, then can find Dregen!\"\n\"Could knight tools and tinker tools be used together? Web think need work together. Too weak apart.\"\n\"Florian and Daysong friends, yes?\"\n\"These mason secrets? Web want know what private. Don't like secrets if don't have to keep.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:01:00.154000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743016172739493951","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"It is unknow what a fusion of the Knights Methods and the Mason's methods would produce.\" \"Florian and Daysong were friendly and allied.\" \"I am not the arbiter of information and cannot judge for you that which must remain secret. That job belongs to the Archivist. Mason secrets are protected to prevent certain rival organizations from enabling Croatoan to be victorious and Consume the Old World Gods.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:03:52.358000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743016895015288942","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Web thinks for a second. *Wren trusts me, right? I don't need to tell everything but it couldn't hurt to say a few things...*","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:04:50.469000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743017138750488577","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"(oof)","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:05:01.349000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743017184384778250","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
