{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Were ever masons who followed hunger? Or used masonic means to support it?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:05:32.762000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743017316140449822","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"The Result would be chaotic. It is unclear if it would be Chaotic good or Chaotic Evil.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:05:40.221000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743017347425632366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"There have been Masons who were redeemed from several of the Organizations that support the Hunger's rise. Most notably the Illuminati and the Golden Dawn. All hermtic orders have a stake in the outcome.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:07:02.959000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743017694454087694","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Would Golden Dawn and Illuminati use same symbols as masons? They shared by all hermetic orders?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:08:02.259000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743017943176183888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"All of the Hermetic Orders share a common root in the lost civilization of Brunelocks. Of which there are several still living. Noteable examples include Master Hiram and Solomon.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:09:27.596000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743018301105373205","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"All use same symbols though?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:10:00.920000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743018440876621876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"There are certain symbols, such as the All Seeing eye that both sides claim. In truth, it is the symbol of the Royal House of the Brunelocks and is etched in Hiram's Crown. It is the source of Solomons jealousy. Other symbols such as the compass and ruler belong strictly to the Masons.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:11:53.938000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743018914908209182","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
